# Breakdown

Purpose: distribution at a glance — how instances split across a
field's values. Exists because "128 deals" hides the shape; the shape
(45% stuck in open) is usually the actionable part.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| chart | layout | 🔥 | bar (horizontal) / pie (donut) | |
| title | display | 🔥 | text | |
| groupBy | data | 🔥 | enum / user / relation field | |
| concept | filter | 🔥 | conceptId / inherit | |
| conditions | filter | 🔥 | SidebarCondition[] | |
| match | filter | 🔥 | all / any | |
| sort | display | ⭐ | by count / by label / field order | |
| values | display | ⭐ | count / percent / both | on bars or legend |
| other bucket | display | ⭐ | collapse past n groups (default 6) | |
| legend position | layout | 💤 | right / bottom / off | pie only |
| icon | display | 💤 | icon name / none | |
| empty groups | display | 💤 | hide (default) / show | |
| total | display | 💤 | on / off | pie center / bar footer |
